{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>והיה.</b> He mentioned concerning both commandments 'והיה לאות על ידכה', and what the Sages transmitted to write the passages [in tefillin] is the truth." "<b>ולטוטפת.</b> Like 'זכרון' [remembrance]. Some say the tet is doubled, and explain it as a thing, from the root 'והטף אל דרום' (Ezekiel 21:2). This is far-fetched in my eyes."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:12.148751177Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}